sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Requester
  actor C as Courier
  participant O as Order Service
  participant S as Supplier Service
  participant Cr as Credit Service
  participant U as User Service
  participant P as Pub/Sub

  rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
  Note over R,U: Synchronous: the caller needs the answer now
  R->>O: Create errand (pickup, delivery, credits)
  O->>S: Validate pickup + delivery
  S-->>O: Both exist and are active
  O->>Cr: Reserve the requester's credits
  Cr-->>O: Reserved
  O-->>R: Errand OPEN
  C->>O: Accept errand
  O->>U: Courier allowed? (role, not suspended)
  U-->>O: Yes
  O->>Cr: Assign courier to the reservation
  Cr-->>O: Assigned (first courier wins)
  O-->>C: Errand ACCEPTED
  end

  C->>O: Start, picked up, delivered
  R->>O: Confirm completion
  Note over O: #nbsp;#nbsp;COMPLETED + event in the outbox, one transaction#nbsp;#nbsp;

  rect rgb(254, 239, 227)
  Note over O,P: Asynchronous: the result can follow
  O-)P: order-completion, courier reward
  P-)Cr: Push: pay the courier from the reservation
  P-)U: Push: courier penalty -1
  end
